        <p class="eyebrow">Biography</p>
        <h2>Classical Training, International Career</h2>
        <p>Valentin Voroshilov is a violinist based in Koh Samui, Thailand, available for performances worldwide. His musical foundation was built at the Rimsky-Korsakov St. Petersburg Conservatory, one of Russia's principal centers for classical music education, where he studied for approximately eight years.</p>
        <p>Since graduating, Valentin has built a professional career spanning more than fifteen years, performing across a wide range of settings — from wedding ceremonies and receptions to corporate functions, private celebrations and other significant occasions. His experience includes performances across numerous countries, working alongside event planners, hotels, orchestras and fellow musicians to deliver live violin music suited to the occasion.</p>
