        <p class="eyebrow">Approach</p>
        <h2>Versatility as a Performer</h2>
        <p>Versatility is central to his approach. Valentin adapts his repertoire and performance style to the context of each event, whether that calls for the intimacy of a solo violin during a ceremony, a more energetic pairing with a DJ or ensemble, or collaboration with a full orchestra for a larger production. This adaptability, combined with his classical training, allows him to perform confidently across formats and audiences.</p>
        <p>Beyond live events, Valentin shares his performances with an online audience of over 120,000 followers on TikTok, extending his work as a violinist beyond the stage. He continues to be based in Koh Samui while remaining available for engagements internationally.</p>
